# Optional debug flags for the vibefly-agent process (not commit config).
# Commit model, language, and prompt are set in IDE Settings > Vibe Fly >
# Commit Message / Providers and sent via RPC.

# Log level: error | warn | info | http | verbose | debug | silly (default: info)
# All logs go to stderr. Full commit LLM context dumps require debug.
# VIBEFLY_LOG_LEVEL=debug
